", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Detailed Message", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about unlikely events or fairly certain conditions that will be fulfilled in the present, past or future in spoken or written texts and in work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Perfect Modals: <span class=\"italic\">May</span>/<span class=\"italic\">Might Have</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When you want to express uncertainty about the past, you can use Perfect modals. This is a way for you to speculate about a reason for something else happening.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">may have</span></span> or <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">might have</span></span>  + past participle to express a weak possibility in the past. <br/><br/> For example: <span class=\"italic\"> I don't know where I lost my wallet. I  <span class=\"strong\">may have lost </span> it on the train or I <span class=\"strong\">might have dropped</span> it on the bus. I really have no idea. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "He said that he may have lost his passport in the Amazon jungle.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He mentioned that one of the more enterprising assistants might have found it and stored it for him.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "However, he did add that it may have been lost for good.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He said that he might have even taken some award-caliber pictures.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He said that he might have been able to catch a flight in early August, but that because of the delay it might be more like September.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Clauses Using <span class=\"italic\">-ing </span>with Objects or Possessives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Let's look at some more variations on the structure of clauses.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use an object + <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> or a possessive + <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> after some verbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">  I resented <span class=\"strong\">Sheila receiving</span> a raise.<br/> I resented <span class=\"strong\">Sheila's receiving</span> a raise.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you use a possessive + <span class=\"italic\">ing</span>, it sounds much more formal than the object + <span class=\"strong\">ing</span>. You only use the possessive form to talk about a person or a group of people. You cannot use it with animals or things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Other verbs you can use in this structure are:  <span class=\"italic\">detest</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">approve</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">disapprove</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">like</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">dislike</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">hate</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">love</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">object to</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">forget</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">imagine</span>, and  <span class=\"italic\">remember</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Sari detested Tom's constant traveling.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She objected to his disappearing for days at time with little to no contact.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Louise disliked their putting her in the middle of the relationship.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She resented his having left another message, but of course she was pleased to receive an update.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "eagerly ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "with desire and interest", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Every week she would wait eagerly for his phone call, but he didn't always catch her at home. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about a long-distance relationship.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "devotion", "type": "name"}, {"content": "love, loyalty, or enthusiasm for a person, activity, or cause", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She objected to his disappearing for days at a time with little to no contact, but she put up with it out of devotion.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "conscientiously", "type": "name"}, {"content": "carefully", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She conscientiously recorded the messages regardless.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "enterprising", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having or showing initiative and resourcefulness", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He mentioned that one of the more enterprising assistants might have found it and stored it for him.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "caliber\t", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the quality of someone's character or the level of someone's ability", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He said that he might have even taken some award-caliber pictures.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le08ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Ask a partner to give you a recap of his or her activities over the course of the previous weekend over the phone.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take notes in point form.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Switch partners and relate your first partner's activities to your new partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I listen to my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I take notes on what my partner did.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I relate a message to a third person.", "type": "text"}]}]}